{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2022-08-18 16:30:00', 'title': 'MEDTRONIC ANNOUNCES CASH DIVIDEND FOR SECOND QUARTER OF FISCAL YEAR 2023', 'text': 'DUBLIN, AUG. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF MEDTRONIC PLC (NYSE:MDT) ON THURSDAY, AUGUST 18, 2022, APPROVED THE FISCAL YEAR 2023 SECOND QUARTER CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.68 PER ORDINARY SHARE, REPRESENTING AN 8% INCREASE OVER THE PRIOR YEAR. THIS QUARTERLY DECLARATION IS CONSISTENT WITH THE DIVIDEND ANNOUNCEMENT MADE BY THE COMPANY IN MAY 2022.'}